Benchmark data license
======================

Scope: everything under `EviLens/benchmark/` -- the question files
(`counting.jsonl`, `segmentation.jsonl`, `grounding/*.jsonl`), the
ground-truth masks under `EviLens/benchmark/masks/`, and the images distributed
separately and fetched by `EviLens/scripts/download_images.py` into
`EviLens/benchmark/images/`.

